      "body": "I also encountered this problem. The model I trained and evaluated on 4 3090s, the author's total_batch_size is 16*1*8=128, I set deepspeed's gradient_accumulation_steps=16, so my total_batch_size=2*16*4=128. For other parameters, I only reduced the number of GPUs to 4, but the final results were the same as the original poster's. The loss and other evaluation metric curves were not normal. No matter how I evaluated the model, the success rate remained at 0\nThe curve in front is the base_only model curve, and the curve at the back is the AC-DiT model curve, The curve of this AC-DiT model is quite abnormal\n\n<img width=\"1718\" height=\"378\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c0fda0e-943c-4081-9aab-df54a749f0dd\" />\n\n<img width=\"1580\" height=\"629\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42ff7dd9-df1a-4be6-9fa2-351519535daf\" />\n\n<img width=\"1579\" height=\"645\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9a8cc55-468a-4432-81c4-901db36ce2e3\" />\n\n<img width=\"1570\" height=\"644\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9901366f-b47d-4936-acf7-90452d7d6f18\" />\n\n<img width=\"1563\" height=\"656\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5cb0d31-8def-48ba-8471-0310fd9e2bda\" />\n\n<img width=\"1570\" height=\"683\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/231f048f-a802-4c53-80cb-8d6ba874cb06\" />\n\n<img width=\"1570\" height=\"707\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86edccd2-e875-4741-8605-7d6bec4fb247\" />\n\n<img width=\"1571\" height=\"683\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c1e3b79-99ae-4797-b522-5ddf630eab8e\" />",
